OL,3,CAmanda Knox defends comedy show after
OL,4,CMeredith Kercher's sister speaks out
OL,6,FAmanda Knox has defended her new
OL,7,Fcomedy show 'Cartwheel' after Meredith
OL,8,FKercher's sister claimed the
OL,9,Fperformance "normalises and
OL,10,Ftrivialises violence against women".
OL,12,FBritish exchange student Meredith
OL,13,FKercher was killed in Perugia in 2007,
OL,14,Fand Knox, her American roommate, was
OL,15,Fwrongly convicted of her murder and
OL,16,Fsexual assault in 2009, alongside her
OL,17,Fthen-boyfriend, Raffaele Sollecito.
OL,26,@rD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
