OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786126702
OL,3,CAmanda Knox defends comedy show after
OL,4,CMeredith Kercher's sister speaks out
OL,6,FThe pair maintained their innocence
OL,7,Fand were both released in 2011 after
OL,8,Fan Italian appeals court overturned
OL,9,Ftheir convictions, and they were
OL,10,Fpermanently and completely acquitted
OL,11,Fby Italy's highest court in 2015.
OL,13,FKnox is now set to perform her show
OL,14,F'Cartwheel' at this year's Edinburgh
OL,15,FFringe, but a petition has been
OL,16,Flaunched calling for its cancellation.
OL,18,FStephanie Kercher, Meredith's sister,
OL,19,Fsaid her problem with the show was
OL,20,Fthat it was a comedy.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786126702
OL,3,CAmanda Knox defends comedy show after
OL,4,CMeredith Kercher's sister speaks out
OL,6,F"Amanda is naturally free to continue
OL,7,Fwith her life as she wishes, but I
OL,8,Fthink the problem with this particular
OL,9,Fproject is that it is comedy," she
OL,10,Ftold BBC Breakfast.
OL,12,F"And whilst I appreciate comedy is
OL,13,Fthere to push the boundaries... it
OL,14,Fvery much normalises and trivialises
OL,15,Fviolence against women and Meredith in
OL,16,Fparticular.
OL,26,@tD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786126702
OL,3,CAmanda Knox defends comedy show after
OL,4,CMeredith Kercher's sister speaks out
OL,6,F"I think in this case it's a position
OL,7,Fwhere it's not a generic topic, it's
OL,8,Ftargeting an individual traumatic case
OL,9,Fand an individual person and family,
OL,10,Fand I feel very strongly that Meredith
OL,11,Fwouldn't agree with that.
OL,13,F"And obviously, I have read certain
OL,14,Fcomments that she's made that Meredith
OL,15,Fwould have found it funny, and
OL,16,FMeredith absolutely wouldn't find
OL,17,Fthese topics of any comedy value."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUyD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
