PN,31505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786126702
OL,3,CAmanda Knox defends comedy show after
OL,4,CMeredith Kercher's sister speaks out
OL,6,FShe added: "It's not about whether
OL,7,Fpeople think she's guilty or innocent,
OL,8,Fif someone else was doing the show
OL,9,Fspecifically against Meredith, I would
OL,10,Fstill feel the same, it is obviously
OL,11,Fan added wound that it's coming from
OL,12,Fher at the same time, but I do feel
OL,13,Fvery strongly that it should be
OL,14,Fsomething that's not given a platform."
OL,16,FThe title of the show refers to claims
OL,17,Fthat Knox performed cartwheels at a
OL,18,Fpolice station after Kercher's death -
OL,19,Fa claim she has disputed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
