OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786126702
OL,3,CAmanda Knox defends comedy show after
OL,4,CMeredith Kercher's sister speaks out
OL,6,FIn an interview with The Telegraph
OL,7,Fearlier this month, Knox said that she
OL,8,Fbelieved Kercher would "appreciate the
OL,9,Fshow because it grapples with what it
OL,10,Fmeans to be a young woman" and "is
OL,11,Fhonest", adding that she thought her
OL,12,Flate roommate would have found it
OL,13,F"funny".
OL,15,FOn Thursday, Knox shared a statement
OL,16,Fagainst the petition on social media,
OL,17,Fstating that the author behind it "nor
OL,18,Fanyone who signed it" had seen
OL,19,F'Cartwheel'.
OL,26,@pD@XOUsD@GO]uD@AOUuD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
