PN,31507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786126702
OL,3,CAmanda Knox defends comedy show after
OL,4,CMeredith Kercher's sister speaks out
OL,6,F"Cartwheel is a show about motherhood,
OL,7,Fraising a daughter in a world that is
OL,8,Funfair and dangerous for women, and
OL,9,Fwhat it costs to be the kind of mother
OL,10,Fwho tells her the truth about that,"
OL,11,FKnox said.
OL,13,F"Neither the author of this petition
OL,14,Fnor anyone who signed it has seen
OL,15,FCartwheel. The petition contains many
OL,16,Ffalse assumptions and completely
OL,17,Fmischaracterises the show.
OL,19,F"Cartwheel honors Meredith Kercher's
OL,20,Fmemory and calls out the violence that
OL,21,Fwas done to her and to me.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
