PN,31508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786126702
OL,3,CAmanda Knox defends comedy show after
OL,4,CMeredith Kercher's sister speaks out
OL,6,F"A petition to cancel a show no one
OL,7,Fhas seen, on the grounds of false
OL,8,Faccusations intended to shame and
OL,9,Fvilify a wronged woman into silence,
OL,10,Fis not an argument against Cartwheel.
OL,12,F"It's a fairly precise description of
OL,13,Fwhat Cartwheel is about and why it
OL,14,Fdeserves to exist."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
