OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786126702
OL,3,CAmanda Knox defends comedy show after
OL,4,CMeredith Kercher's sister speaks out
OL,6,FKnox added: "Many of the Fringe's most
OL,7,Fcelebrated comedy shows tackle
OL,8,Fdifficult subjects including grief,
OL,9,Ftrauma, mental health, addiction,
OL,10,Fillness, identity, and politics.
OL,11,FComics rarely treat these experiences
OL,12,Flightly or make them the butt of the
OL,13,Fjoke.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786126702
OL,3,CAmanda Knox defends comedy show after
OL,4,CMeredith Kercher's sister speaks out
OL,6,F"Instead, they use comedy as a way to
OL,7,Fexplore them, creating space for
OL,8,Faudiences to engage with complex
OL,9,Fideas, connect through shared
OL,10,Fexperience, and find moments of
OL,11,Frelief, perspective and hope in
OL,12,Fsubjects that might otherwise feel
OL,13,Foverwhelming."
OL,15,FRudy Hermann Guede was convicted of
OL,16,FKercher's murder in 2008.
OL,18,FHe was released from prison in 2021
OL,19,Fafter serving 13 years of a 16-year
OL,20,Fterm.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/11
